   RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
   Strategy:
   - ≥ 1440px  : large desktop   → 4–5 card columns, tall hero
   - 1025–1439px: laptop          → 4 columns, content max 1200px
   - 769–1024px : tablet landscape → 3 columns, tighter padding
