   - 481–640px  : phone landscape  → 2 columns, compact
   - ≤ 480px   : phone portrait   → 2 columns, minimal
   - ≤ 380px   : small phone      → 1 column, bare minimum
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ── Large desktop (≥ 1440px) ── */
@media (min-width: 1440px) {
  .hero {
    height: 540px;
